   … `L6`. 6 nodes, F.
2. `tests/test_h_mad_new_caller_carveout_copies.py::test_locator_refuses_zero_or_many_spans` — each
   locator × `zero` and `two`, over doctored copies of its source text. 12 nodes, P (they exercise
